{"sections":[{"slug":"微分分次Lie代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"微分分次Lie代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">微分分次</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"微分分次 Lie 代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">微分分次</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">微分分次</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> (DGLA) $(L,[-,-],d)$ <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$-<span lang=\"zh\">分次线性空间</span> $L=\\bigoplus_{i\\in\\mathbb{Z}} L^i$, Lie <span lang=\"zh\">括号</span> $[-,-]\\colon L^i\\times L^j\\to L^{i+j}$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及微分</span> $d\\colon L^i \\to L^{i+1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">分次交换性</span>$$[b,a]=(-1)^{\\bar a\\bar b}[a,b],$$</li>\n<li>Jacobi <span lang=\"zh\">恒等式</span>$$\r\n[a,[b,c]] = [[a,b],c]+ (-1)^{\\bar a \\bar b}[b,[a,c]],\r\n$$</li>\n<li>Leibniz <span lang=\"zh\">法则</span>$$\r\nd[a,b]=[da,b]+(-1)^{\\bar a}[a,db],\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $dd=0$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Jacobi <span lang=\"zh\">恒等式可理解为</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $a\\in L^i$, $\\operatorname{ad}(a)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $i$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶导子</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对微分流形</span> $M$, Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">值微分形式</span> $\\big(\\Omega^\\bullet(M,\\mathfrak g),[-,-],d\\big)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是微分分次</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}